					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1143892#post-2248926</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1143892/command-query-separation#post-2248926</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2015 14:59:59 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>LurkD</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1500566</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The latter because I can't program a security bypassing utility program like an AI would. So it's supposed to be code but is really gobbledy-gook.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">EASTER&nbsp;EGG</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">It's&nbsp;hard&nbsp;boiled&nbsp;chocolate</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>It's actually CROM's image slapped into notepad. So there's <em>some</em> connection. Just add '‰PNG' to the top there and recompile it and it should make a CROM image.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
