					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1143892#post-2247950</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1143892/command-query-separation#post-2247950</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 09 Mar 2015 20:40:31 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Decibelles</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2005044</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>While this is certainly a continuation, there's nothing much here I can support in terms of story. It feels like an in-between from the first tale to the next. Even though it's setting up future events, it doesn't do so in any particularly interesting way. I also get the feeling that this format might be tough to stick with as far as reading if there's a whole series focused on it.</p> <p>No-vote.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
